    "Choose Banner, write your text and pick colors, then tap the floor. The banner stays in place, and people standing in front look like they're holding it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "현수막 모드에서 문구와 색을 정하고 바닥을 탭하세요. 현수막이 그 자리에 떠 있고, 앞에 선 사람들이 들고 있는 것처럼 찍혀요."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「横断幕」を選び、文字と色を決めて床をタップ。横断幕がその場に浮かび、前に立つ人たちが持っているように写ります。"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose Banner, write your text and pick colours, then tap the floor. The banner stays in place, and people standing in front look like they're holding it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
